   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **(new song)** (1 review): Track 5 is a new song whose title the reviewer does not know [3]\n- **Maceo** (1 review): Reviewer identifies track 7 as Maceo [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **(new song)**: rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n- **Maceo**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [5]\n- **Don't Think Too Much**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Neal Evans keyboard solo**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Super Bad**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Upright, PJ's [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2008-12-29** (recommended): audience recording; 15 songs; 113 min; rated 2/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says the audience recording sounds really good [3]\n- **soulive2008-12-29.flac24**: audience recording; 15 songs; 113 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Ryan Zoidas and Sam Kininger played horns for most of the show [1]\n- Ryan Zoidas and Sam Kininger played horns for most of the show [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2008-12-29**: taped by Scott Bernstein; transferred by Scott Bernstein; source: Audience [1]. Also: A higher-quality 24 bit version of this recording is available separately from the uploader [1]\n- **soulive2008-12-29.flac24**: taped by Scott Bernstein; transferred by Scott Bernstein; source: Audience [2]",
